<!--
	Title: feature_set.xml
	Date: 7-18-2025
	Author: ASP, KM
	Purpose: XML based information that CNC12 parses into feature_set.htm
	Copyright SMC 2025
	
	Note: Since both XML and HTML are markup languages, they both use a tag system
	      To include a tag intended to be parsed by the html and not by the xml,
		  we have to cheat a little bit. Tags intended for html parsing should
		  start and end with &lt; and &gt; instead of < and > respectively.
		  Thus we get:
		  <name>&lt;a href="www.centroidcnc.com"&gt;See the website for more info&lt;/a&gt;</name>
		  to enter <a href="www.centroidcnc.com">See the website for more info</a>
		  into the parsed html with a working hyperlink.
		  Not all modern html tags are supported by CNC12. Please see this list
		  for supported tags: https://docs.wxwidgets.org/3.2/overview_html.html#overview_html_supptags
-->
